(Bug #27 regression: Repeat nested inside If, closed with two periods.
 The first period closes the Repeat (the innermost clause), the second
 closes the If, so "after" runs once. Before the fix the Repeat did not
 consume its period and the second period had nothing to close, failing
 with `Expected a statement, got Period`. Expected: r, r, after.)

a number called n is 1.
If n is equal to 1 then,
    Repeat 2 times, Print "r"..
Print "after".